item.description:
Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup
join your friends of the Lancaster Bike Club and Rails and Trails Club for a Sunday afternoon ride on the Northwest River Trail. Plenty of street parking around 40 East Front Street, Marietta, across from the River Trail Pub. We leave at 2pm and ride from Marietta to the Falmouth Boat Launch. This trail is paved; any kind of bike will do. This is a casual ride. Please do not sign up if you will not stay with the group. No one will be left behind. 24 miles total flat along the mighty Susquehanna River. After returning to our cars, those who would like yummy food and drinks at the River trail Pub. Like always helmets are required and have a tube for your bike so someone can fix a flat.
To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver, we encourage LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP also allows us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you are not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy;
